ar - Shoot<br></li><li>Hold spacebar for autofire<br></li><li>Escape / P - Pause<br></li><li>Enter - Resume<br></li><li>F4 - Toggle fullscreen<br></li><li>Shift + R - Back to Menu</li></ul>",
